# File Organizer — Otter Dogfooding Milestone #1, program 1 of 3
#
# Exercises: files, folders, discovery, lists, loops, conditions, input.
#
# This is Jeff's original draft, with one change: the multi-line
#
#     if extension of file is ".jpg" or
#        extension of file is ".png"
#
# does not parse today. Otter has no statement-continuation grammar yet
# (D38, deliberately deferred — see SPEC-DECISIONS.md). Rewritten to fit
# on one line, which is already valid Otter; nothing else about the
# program changed.

say "Otter File Organizer"

ask "What folder should I organize?" and call it folder

get files in folder into files

pictures are empty

each file in files
    if extension of file is ".jpg" or extension of file is ".png"
        add file to pictures
    .
.

create folder "Organized Pictures"

each picture in pictures
    copy picture to "Organized Pictures"
.

say "Organized" length of pictures "pictures."
